{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/a25f7aa5d7fd505169fcc0533d89638c.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/a25f7aa5d7fd505169fcc0533d89638c.webp?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seemed like a normal day on the farm. Gibba and his tiny dog Habanilla were carefree - just jumping and dashing around, before tragedy struck! Rocko The Rumbler broke through and stole Habanilla!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/d2b20f82b015bc8745351c5ab08d2b97.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/d2b20f82b015bc8745351c5ab08d2b97.webp?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Gibba - a ball of clay with stick legs and googly eyes and a lot of heart. You'll have to leave the comfort of the farm and go through the woods and by dashing and squashing your way if you want to reunite with Habanilla again! Will you be up to the challenge of defeating Rocko to save Habanilla?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the woods and caves and solve puzzles, break through walls and bounce on platforms as you attempt to breach Rocko\u2019s Castle!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/04c88515e43593059483f60ed095a46b.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/04c88515e43593059483f60ed095a46b.avif?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Different Levels and One Big Bad Boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and Stylized Environments!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple movement options to cut through the game - including air dashes and super bounces!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tracking - Improve your execution and find loopholes to save Habanilla even faster!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Development Team for this game was composed of students of the University of Utah's Games Masters' Program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690050?t=1755187506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/64f30db675ade2d59c4720ccb3c25772821cd2d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755187506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/d0d269326238db4171de6a76dcc6c1a3b7f5d513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755187506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/d0d269326238db4171de6a76dcc6c1a3b7f5d513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755187506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/a25f7aa5d7fd505169fcc0533d89638c.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/a25f7aa5d7fd505169fcc0533d89638c.webp?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seemed like a normal day on the farm. Gibba and his tiny dog Habanilla were carefree - just jumping and dashing around, before tragedy struck! Rocko The Rumbler broke through and stole Habanilla!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/d2b20f82b015bc8745351c5ab08d2b97.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/d2b20f82b015bc8745351c5ab08d2b97.webp?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=517 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Gibba - a ball of clay with stick legs and googly eyes and a lot of heart. You'll have to leave the comfort of the farm and go through the woods and by dashing and squashing your way if you want to reunite with Habanilla again! Will you be up to the challenge of defeating Rocko to save Habanilla?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the woods and caves and solve puzzles, break through walls and bounce on platforms as you attempt to breach Rocko\u2019s Castle!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras/04c88515e43593059483f60ed095a46b.avif?t=1755187506\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/extras_big/04c88515e43593059483f60ed095a46b.avif?t=1755187506 width=1600 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Different Levels and One Big Bad Boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and Stylized Environments!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple movement options to cut through the game - including air dashes and super bounces!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time tracking - Improve your execution and find loopholes to save Habanilla even faster!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Development Team for this game was composed of students of the University of Utah's Games Masters' Program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Studio Gibbs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690050/fd4744e11f34f7703f3cec3a38714c7a30c0be55/header.jpg?t=1755187506","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690050/1347832989/d6b9834ca7dbe8d5b0c9b81a6e742023b7ddc009/1753855145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755187504","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690050/1347832989/d6b9834ca7dbe8d5b0c9b81a6e742023b7ddc009/1753855145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755187504","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690050/1347832989/d6b9834ca7dbe8d5b0c9b81a6e742023b7ddc009/1753855145/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755187504","id":257175590,"name":"GibbaGibbaEarlyTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175590/25a5dcec95c60578cfb0cfaa213af7bda3901fe0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755187504"}],"name":"Gibba Gibba!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core I5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi